{"asset_key":"ep8/quest_story_18260430","episode":"ep8","category":"quest_story","story_id":"18260430","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1826043001:1":{"text":"三日月通りは相変わらず賑やかだな。","source_cn":"月弯街还是这么繁华又喧闹。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x654D456F3D91656B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1826043002:1":{"text":"先日、この通りで爆破事件があったそうだな。近衛隊長のグリーズルまで重傷を負ったとか。さぞ大きな被害が出たのでは？","source_cn":"听闻前阵子街上发生了爆炸，连我们的禁卫军长官格瑞泽尔勒...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0AAA8FAA39D73C7C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1826043003:1":{"text":"今の状況はどうなっている？事故の原因は判明したのか？","source_cn":"现在情况如何？事故原因的调查结果有了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8DB11B0E06F179CC","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1826043004:1":{"text":"申し訳ありません。私の管轄ではないので、詳しいことは何も……","source_cn":"抱歉，我并不负责相关事务，因此不清楚。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA1A252BB2F5A4589","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1826043005:1":{"text":"この程度のことも把握していない者を案内役に寄越すとは。まさか、テペシュ様は私を適当にあしらうつもりではないだろうな？","source_cn":"连这种小事都不清楚，苔佩希小姐却派你来招待，该不会是想...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x332861A1D40EB384","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1826043006:1":{"text":"領主様のご意向を、私が勝手に推し量るわけにはまいりませんので……","source_cn":"我不敢随意揣度领主阁下的用意。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x57563D39D8F01198","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1826043007:1":{"text":"そう緊張するな、主に忠実なコウモリ君。","source_cn":"别紧张，忠心耿耿的蝙蝠。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x32648A9DC4DD1050","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1826043008:1":{"text":"なら、爆発が起きた場所ぐらいは知っているだろう？","source_cn":"那么，你至少知道发生爆炸的事故地点吧？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3309D1F9DFC21E3C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1826043009:1":{"text":"そこに案内してくれ。テペシュ様のお悩みを解決して差し上げられるかもしれん。","source_cn":"带我过去，说不定我能为苔佩希小姐排忧解难。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x6A1940F99CC59384","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1826043010:1":{"text":"申し訳ございません。フォールンキングがお遣わしになった大切なお客様に、ノヴァリスのことでお手を煩わせてはならないと、領主様から申しつかっておりますので。","source_cn":"很抱歉，我不能这么做。领主阁下嘱咐过，您是骸骨之王派来...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2E35FBB2ED7AC44F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1826043011:1":{"text":"ほう……ずいぶんと色々申しつけられているのだな。","source_cn":"哦……原来她还嘱咐了这么多啊。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x914BD258ADA17C1E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1826043012:0":{"text":"好吧，那就不去<style=\"highlight\">黑金商会分部</style>了。<u><link=Case><style=highlight>反正苔佩希小姐是他们的七长老之一</style></link></u>，我相信她会妥善处理这件事。","source_cn":"好吧，那就不去<style=highlight>黑金商...","status":"target_text_empty","hash_xxh64":"0x7DA67B349518D934","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1826043013:1":{"text":"なっ……","source_cn":"您……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8D28EABD325D5B2E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1826043014:1":{"text":"ふふっ、その驚いた顔、実にいいねぇ。そこに恐怖の色も浮かんでいれば、なおよかったのだがなあ。","source_cn":"呵呵，我喜欢你这副惊讶的表情，若是再多些畏惧就更好了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBBB4AF81C9DA119D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1826043015:1":{"text":"ノヴァリスはバンティスの領土。フォールンキングの目を欺けると思うな――しかと覚えておけ。","source_cn":"诺珐斯是班题斯的领土，没有任何事能瞒过骸骨之王——牢牢...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xA9D3927787BFEFAF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1826043016:1":{"text":"……はい。","source_cn":"……是。<key:dialog88>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x1ADFDCABC60E06C4","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:18:1826043017:1":{"text":"ブライトの伝説の女優セレネが、死後はノヴァリスにいると聞いた。一度会ってみたいのだが、案内してくれるかな？まさかテペシュ様も、劇場まで立入禁止にはしていないだろう？","source_cn":"听闻耀光的传奇女星塞涅死后一直生活于诺珐斯，我想见她一...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x65A558833F2297FD","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:19:1826043018:1":{"text":"本日は公演がございませんので、セレネ様がいらっしゃるとは限りませんよ。","source_cn":"今日海歌剧院没有演出，您未必能见到塞涅小姐。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x327863103CACB72B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1826043019:1":{"text":"行ってみなければ分からないだろう。案外、セレネ嬢とはすぐに打ち解けられるかもしれないぞ。","source_cn":"总要试试才知道。说不定，我和塞涅小姐会一见如故。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFE317892E2AC0D3D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:21:1826043020:1":{"text":"それとも、マーレ歌劇場より、私にブラックゴールド商会の廃屋へ行ってほしいのかな？","source_cn":"还是说，比起海歌剧院，你宁可我去黑金商会的废墟上看看？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xFDA291E71D09C2E8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:22:1826043021:1":{"text":"……","source_cn":"……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC4D94AD9463C9058","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1826043022:1":{"text":"<style=\"highlight\">マーレ歌劇場</style>は三日月通りの東です。ご案内いたします。","source_cn":"<style=highlight>海歌剧院</styl...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x2CABDDF3EEBF2949","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""}},"speakers":{"speaker:斯莱泽":{"text":"スレーザー","source":"斯莱泽","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"},"speaker:仆人崔斯":{"text":"使用人のズイス","source":"仆人崔斯","status":"matched_dialogue_flow"}},"stats":{"flow_row_count":23,"localized_text_count":22,"speaker_count":2}}